# Where the data lives.
#
# Unset (the default) means a local SQLite file at data/app.db, which is
# created and migrated on first query - so `pnpm dev` needs no setup at all.
#
# Point it at Turso for a deployment. Turso is libSQL, which is SQLite, so
# every query in the app is identical in both places.
#
#   KITAAB_DB_URL=libsql://<your-database>-<org>.turso.io
#   KITAAB_DB_TOKEN=<auth token from `turso db tokens create <database>`>
#
# A remote database is never migrated implicitly. Apply the schema on purpose:
#
#   KITAAB_DB_URL=... KITAAB_DB_TOKEN=... pnpm db:push
